{
    "title": "Girls Nail Salon - Nail Games",
    "description": "Welcome to Girls Nail Salon - Nail Games, where creativity meets beauty in an exciting nail art adventure! \ud83d\udc85\u2728 Step into our vibrant salon and get ready to pamper your clients with stunning nail makeovers.\r\n\r\nIn Girls Nail Salon - Nail Games, you\u2019ll start by welcoming your customers and giving their nails the ultimate transformation. Follow these steps to create dazzling designs:\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udd8c\ufe0f Cut off the broken nail: Begin by trimming any broken or damaged nails to ensure a fresh start.\r\n\ud83d\udc85 Choose a new nail shape: Select from a variety of shapes to suit your client's style.\r\n\ud83c\udfa8 Choose a color: Explore a wide palette of colors to find the perfect shade for every mood.\r\n\u2728 Choose your decoration options: Add intricate designs, sparkling gems, and fun patterns to make each nail a masterpiece.\r\n\ud83d\udc69\u200d\ud83c\udfa8 Try to fulfill the requests of the guests: Listen to your clients' desires and strive to meet their nail art dreams.\r\n\ud83c\udf1f Enjoy your final artwork: Admire the beautiful nails you\u2019ve crafted and see the smiles on your clients' faces.\r\n\r\nWith DIY Nail - Nail Salon Games, you have the freedom to express your creativity and design unique nail art. The game features the latest trends in Nail Art 3D - Acrylic Nails Simulator, offering realistic and immersive nail styling experiences.\r\n\r\nGet ready to become the ultimate nail artist! Download Girls Nail Salon - Nail Games now and dive into the world of dazzling nails and endless fun! \ud83c\udf89\ud83d\udcf2\ud83d\udc96",
    "descriptionHTML": "Welcome to Girls Nail Salon - Nail Games, where creativity meets beauty in an exciting nail art adventure! \ud83d\udc85\u2728 Step into our vibrant salon and get ready to pamper your clients with stunning nail makeovers.<br><br>In Girls Nail Salon - Nail Games, you\u2019ll start by welcoming your customers and giving their nails the ultimate transformation. Follow these steps to create dazzling designs:<br><br>\ud83d\udd8c\ufe0f Cut off the broken nail: Begin by trimming any broken or damaged nails to ensure a fresh start.<br>\ud83d\udc85 Choose a new nail shape: Select from a variety of shapes to suit your client&#39;s style.<br>\ud83c\udfa8 Choose a color: Explore a wide palette of colors to find the perfect shade for every mood.<br>\u2728 Choose your decoration options: Add intricate designs, sparkling gems, and fun patterns to make each nail a masterpiece.<br>\ud83d\udc69\u200d\ud83c\udfa8 Try to fulfill the requests of the guests: Listen to your clients&#39; desires and strive to meet their nail art dreams.<br>\ud83c\udf1f Enjoy your final artwork: Admire the beautiful nails you\u2019ve crafted and see the smiles on your clients&#39; faces.<br><br>With DIY Nail - Nail Salon Games, you have the freedom to express your creativity and design unique nail art. The game features the latest trends in Nail Art 3D - Acrylic Nails Simulator, offering realistic and immersive nail styling experiences.<br><br>Get ready to become the ultimate nail artist! Download Girls Nail Salon - Nail Games now and dive into the world of dazzling nails and endless fun! \ud83c\udf89\ud83d\udcf2\ud83d\udc96",
